      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "Corporate",
      "relevance": "Sector",
      "headline": "IndiGo's quarterly loss narrowed to ₹1,879 crore as revenue rose 25.9%",
      "what": "InterGlobe Aviation (IndiGo) reported a net loss of ₹1,879.1 crore for July to September 2026, against ₹2,582.1 crore a year earlier. Revenue from operations rose 25.9% to ₹23,363.8 crore, while fuel expenses rose 67.2% to ₹9,966.8 crore. Excluding foreign exchange effects, the loss was ₹723.7 crore.",
      "why": "Jet fuel prices and the rupee pass directly into airline costs. The gap between the reported loss and the loss excluding currency effects shows how much exchange-rate moves weighed on the quarter.",
      "source": {
        "name": "The Tribune",
