    {
      "topic": "Corporate",
      "relevance": "Sector",
      "headline": "Godrej Consumer's quarterly profit rose 13.8% as India volumes grew 7%",
      "what": "Godrej Consumer Products reported net profit of ₹522.92 crore for July to September 2026, up 13.8%, on revenue of ₹4,413.09 crore, up 19%. India sales rose 13% to ₹2,631 crore with underlying volume growth of 7%, and the board declared an interim dividend of ₹5 a share.",
      "why": "Volume growth in everyday staples is a direct gauge of household demand. The Nifty FMCG index was among Thursday's strongest sectors, up 2.34%.",
